// /app/app/degenerette.js — Phase 62 Plan 62-03 (BUY-05 write path).
//
// Degenerette bet flow (audit 224de529, docs/DEGENERETTE-BET-QUEUE.md): placeBet
// (single tx, emits DegeneretteBetPlaced) appends ONE word to
// degeneretteQueue[index]. Once that index's lootbox RNG word lands the bet
// SETTLES AUTOMATICALLY: the permissionless mineFlip() keeper sweep (since audit
// 18490c6fe the only door to the chain's work) walks each finalized index's boxes and then its
// bet queue (DegenerusGameLootboxModule.openHumanBoxes → DegeneretteModule
// sweepDegeneretteBets). A player never has to resolve. Audit 2525eb7fd removed
// the cherry-pick door resolveDegeneretteBets(index, betIds); resolveBets() is
// now the optional "settle now" nudge — one mineFlip() call, which settles in
// order whatever is queued ahead of the bet first. Every settlement
// emits one DegeneretteResolved per bet carrying all of its spins.
//
// ⛔ A bet is identified by (index, betId): betId is the queue position + 1
// WITHIN its index, not a per-player nonce. Two of a player's bets at different
// indices routinely share a betId. degeneretteBetKey() folds the pair into the
// contract's own (index << 64) | betId key, which is unique and increases in
// placement order.
//
// AUDIT a5d4d2cd (vendored into degenerus-sim) replaced the old "pick a full
// 4-quadrant custom ticket + a hero quadrant" bet with "pick ONE hero symbol".
// `uint32 customTraits, uint8 heroQuadrant` is gone; the wire now carries a
// single `uint8 symbol` (0..23): `heroQuadrant = symbol >> 3`, the icon within
// that quadrant is `symbol & 7`. The player's full ticket (all four quadrants'
// colors) is generated fresh by the contract every spin — only the chosen
// symbol is forced into its quadrant. See DegenerusGameDegeneretteModule.sol
// `_playerTicket` / `_spinSymbol` in degenerus-sim.
//
// On-chain surfaces (verified against degenerus-audit/contracts, audit 224de529):
//   - DegenerusGameDegeneretteModule.sol — placeDegeneretteBet(player, currency, amountPerSpin, spinCount, symbol) payable
//   - DegenerusGame.sol — mineFlip(): the ordered miner stages, afking boxes, then each
//       finalized index's boxes and its bet queue; permissionless, pays the miner bounty.
//   - DegenerusGame.sol — degeneretteBetInfo(uint48 index, uint64 betId) view: the raw
//       queued word, 0 once resolved (or unknown).
//   - DegeneretteBetPlaced(player, index, betId, packed) / DegeneretteResolved(player,
//       index, betId, totalPayout, resultTraits, spins). The per-spin DegeneretteResult
//       event, the degeneretteResolve community batch (and its BatchAlreadyTaken race
//       error) and WWXRP bets (currency 3 → UnsupportedCurrency) are all gone.
//
// Per-spin payouts are no longer emitted. `spins` carries each spin's player
// traits, score and matched-gold count; the payout follows from those plus the
// bet word's stake and activity snapshot through the module's own payout math,
// which degeneretteSpinPayout() reproduces exactly (same integer operations as
// _degenerettePayout, so it equals what the retired DegeneretteResult.payout
// used to carry — the pre-survival, pre-3-tier-split gross of that spin).
//
// Reason-map codes owned here:
//   - InvalidBet          — zero/below-minimum/non-unit amount, bad spin count or
//                           symbol.
//   - UnsupportedCurrency — any currency other than ETH (0) / FLIP (1).
// RngNotReady is already registered by Phase 56 baseline (R11) — DO NOT re-register.
//
// Inline ABI fragments — DO NOT cross-import /beta/app/constants.js (Pitfall 4).
//
// MANDATORY closure form for every sendTx call (Phase 58 verified by grep gate):
//   CORRECT:   sendTx( (s) => new Contract(addr, ABI, s).method(args), 'Action' )
//   FORBIDDEN: passing a pre-resolved tx promise — captures stale signer.

